{
  "_about": "Design tokens for the LaTeX editor. Roles come from the recon (S01-S16). Values are a neutral placeholder palette, not the original's; replica-brand swaps the values and keeps the names. Light set at the top level of color, dark set under color.dark (flattens to dark-*). Check every change with: python contrast.py replica/design/tokens.json",
